# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[healthy|Healthy]], [[whole]], [[safe]].

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[greet]]; give [[salutation]] to; [[salute]].
#* {{RQ:Milton Paradise Lost|book=I|lines=249–252|text={{...}} Farewel happy Fields / Where Joy for ever dwells: '''Hail''' horrours, hail / Infernal world, and thou profoundeſt Hell / Receive they new Poſſeſſor: {{...}}|year=1873}}
